      "statement": "Each isolate has a V8 heap limit separate from node memory, defaulting to 128 MB via CELLD_V8_HEAP_LIMIT_MB; a near_heap_limit callback latches and recovers by forcing collections, an isolate above 90% of the limit refuses new hibernatable WebSockets and SQL result-set materialization, and it serves again under 75%.",
